      },
      "lineNbr": 128,
      "author": {
        "id": 1885151
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-02-17T15:59:15Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Behavior changed in the updated CLs:\nhttps://android-review.googlesource.com/c/platform/packages/modules/Bluetooth/+/1973909/9\n\nI will change the response either it\u0027s successful or not. That\u0027s why I need a boolean here. Furthermore we would need to rethink the proto interface here, there is no mechanics to answer if the connection was successful or not. So If it\u0027s successful i return the address otherwise I return the default instance.",
      "parentUuid": "060b8d75_70655226",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 128,
        "startChar": 22,
        "endLine": 128,
        "endChar": 43
      },
      "revId": "b97774d00f43bef625c7dd773a0f5d2a2b277dbe",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "196aa266_0373d770",
        "filename": "android/blueberry/server/src/com/android/blueberry/Host.kt",
        "patchSetId": 17
