      "writtenOn": "2022-02-17T15:59:15Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Same as above, I\u0027m checking the CONNECTING state in the CLs:\nhttps://android-review.googlesource.com/c/platform/packages/modules/Bluetooth/+/1973909/9\n\nThe reason why I don\u0027t wait for the CONNECTED it\u0027s because for some test the PTS trigger an L2CAP disconnect Req even before we enter the CONNECTED state",
      "parentUuid": "196aa266_0373d770",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 131,
        "startChar": 18,
        "endLine": 132,
        "endChar": 100
      },
      "revId": "b97774d00f43bef625c7dd773a0f5d2a2b277dbe",
